'''Ultimate Cannonbolt''' is the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]]'s artificially [[Ultimate Forms|evolved]] DNA sample of an [[Arburian Pelarota (Classic)|Arburian Pelarota]].

==Appearance==
Ultimate Cannonbolt looks exactly like [[Cannonbolt (Classic)|Cannonbolt]] does in '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', but he has hard light metallic blue skin. His shell has cylindrical studs that turn into spikes when he goes into his ball form. He has two on each back segment and one on each shoulder, wrist and leg plate. His teeth are similar to Cannonbolt's, but he has two sharp fangs.

Ultimate Cannonbolt's sphere form is similar to Cannonbolt, but grey. The spikes on the armor become pointed when in sphere form.

Ultimate Cannonbolt wears the evolved [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest.

==Powers and Abilities==
