Ultimate Cannonbolt has powers similar to [[Cannonbolt (Classic)|Cannonbolt]]'s, although his shell is now much thicker and metallic, increasing his defensive capabilities. His plates are also covered with studs that turn into spikes when in sphere form, which increase his offensive capabilities. These powers combined make Ultimate Cannonbolt even more unstoppable when in his sphere form, as he has more traction and won't lose as much momentum;{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimate Cannonbolt's Spikes Give Him Traction.PNG]]|group = DM}} is more maneuverable; and can more easily crush obstacles in his way.<ref name="TToE">''[[The Transmogrification of Eunice]]''</ref>{{Refn|[[:File:Spikyboltprofile.PNG]]|group = CN}}

Ultimate Cannonbolt has enhanced strength, as shown when he smashed Sunder to the ground with his fists with ease.<ref name="TToE" /> Ultimate Cannonbolt is also strong enough to make shock waves, as demonstrated when he punched [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|Dr. Animo's]] [[Mutant Frog|mutant frog]].

Ultimate Cannonbolt's body naturally absorbs nuclear energy. This was demonstrated when he held [[P'Andor]] while [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] got him back in his [[Prypiatosian-B Containment Suit|containment suit]].<ref name="THtH">''[[Too Hot to Handle]]''</ref>

Ultimate Cannonbolt can fire his spikes as projectiles.{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimate Cannonbolt Can Fire His Spikes.PNG]]|group = ES}}{{Refn|''[[Ben 10 Ultimate Alien: Power Struggle]]''; [[:File:PS DVD Ultimate Cannonbolt Data.png|file]]|group = DVD}}

==History==
===Ultimate Alien===
*Ultimate Cannonbolt first appeared in ''[[Too Hot to Handle]]'', where he held [[P'Andor]] while [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] placed the former's [[Prypiatosian-B Containment Suit|containment suit]] back on him.
*In ''[[Perplexahedron (Episode)|Perplexahedron]]'', Ultimate Cannonbolt nearly defeated [[Ultimate Aggregor]] only to lose the piece of the [[Map of Infinity]] to him.
*In ''[[The Transmogrification of Eunice]]'', Ultimate Cannonbolt battled [[Sunder]] and rescued [[Eunice]].
*In ''[[It's Not Easy Being Gwen]]'', Ultimate Cannonbolt defeated [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|Dr. Animo]] and his [[Mutant Frog|mutant frog]].

