==Trivia==
*In all his appearances, Ultimate Cannonbolt is the last alien used.
*Ultimate Cannonbolt is the only [[Ultimate Forms|Ultimate form]] introduced in the first two seasons of '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''' who is not playable in ''[[Ben 10 Ultimate Alien: Cosmic Destruction]]''.
*Ultimate Cannonbolt was replaced by his [[Cannonbolt (Classic)|regular form]] for the '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''' version of ''[[Game Creator]]''.
*Ultimate Cannonbolt was the [[Alien of the Month]] in May 2011.
*Ultimate Cannonbolt was designed by [[Glenn Wong]], with color styling by Chris Hooten.{{Refn|https://archive.is/5rOld|group = GW}}
*Ultimate Cannonbolt's involvement in ''[[It's Not Easy Being Gwen]]'' was different at various stages of the episode's production:
**In the script outline dated April 29, 2010, [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] transforms from Ultimate Cannonbolt into [[Brainstorm]] and disables [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|Dr. Animo]]'s transmodulator ray, and [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] and [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] defeat Animo.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/b/bf/INEBG_Script_Outline.pdf ''It's Not Easy Being Gwen'' Script Outline]|group = outline}}
**In the storyboards, after transforming into Cannonbolt for the second time, Ben changes into [[Humungousaur (Classic)|Humungousaur]] off-screen and defeats Dr. Animo as him.{{Refn|https://archive.is/YKoW6|group = JHK}}
*Ultimate Cannonbolt was originally supposed to be used by [[Albedo]] in the dream in ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]''.{{Refn|[[:File:NOTLN DRAFT ONE-23.png]]|group = script}}
*Had Ultimate Cannonbolt appeared in '''Omniverse''' as one of [[Albedo]]'s transformations, [[Derrick J. Wyatt]] would have redesigned him into something more unique compared to what was seen in '''Ultimate Alien'''.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Ultimate Cannonbolt Concept.png]]|group = DJW}}

